Patterns: paint through dither and texture masks. Tap the new Pattern swatch on the Pencil, Brush, Eraser, and Bucket to pick from 116 tiles (Bayer ladders, lines, bricks, checkers); the Gradient gets ordered dithering. Also new: 512x512 canvases, File > Open for PNG/GIF/WebP/JPEG/BMP, a Place step and a zoomable crop editor for imports, Slow drags, hidden tools, an Artwork colors page, a repeatable Bucket fill, two-tap delete confirmation, and fixes.